sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant EXT as VS Code Extension
    participant WV as Webview Panel
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant OR as Orchestrator
    participant AG as Agent Services (×5)

    Dev->>EXT: run CodeSentinel: Review current file
    EXT->>EXT: collect active file + unsaved buffer contents

    alt gateway unreachable or offline
        EXT-->>Dev: connection error, no review is run
        Note over EXT: UC-2 exception flow — nothing is queued locally
    else online
        EXT->>GW: POST /v1/reviews (Bearer cs_live_… API key)
        GW->>GW: authenticate key, resolve user + organization
        GW->>OR: POST /internal/v1/review-jobs (trigger = vscode_on_demand)
        OR-->>GW: 202 { reviewId, eventsUrl }
        GW-->>EXT: 202 accepted
        EXT->>WV: open panel, show reviewing…

        EXT->>GW: GET /v1/reviews/{id}/events (SSE)

        par agents run in parallel
            OR->>AG: POST /v1/review
            AG-->>OR: findings[]
        end

        loop as each agent returns
            OR-->>GW: agent_completed
            GW-->>EXT: SSE agent_completed { agent, findingsCount, latencyMs }
            EXT->>WV: fill in that agent's section
        end

        OR-->>GW: combined report
        GW-->>EXT: SSE review_completed
        EXT->>WV: render findings grouped by agent and severity (FR-VSC-02)
        WV-->>Dev: report with Apply fix and Auto-fix style actions
    end

    opt developer clicks "Auto-fix style" (FR-VSC-04)
        Dev->>WV: Auto-fix style
        WV->>GW: POST /v1/reviews/{id}/style-fixes
        GW-->>WV: patched file contents (no LLM in this path, NFR-07)
        WV->>EXT: write into the open editor buffer
        EXT-->>Dev: buffer updated, still unsaved
    end

    Note over Dev,EXT: applying a single AI fix follows UC-3
